**Brief summary:**

Implement Combat v2 (C1–C5) as five sequential PRs: hit feedback with hit-stop tiers and replicated feedback, poise/stagger system with ×1.25 stagger damage, attack timeline with cancel windows and heavy charge, weapon skills triggered on perfect dodge, and light-hit player reactions with shape-cache optimization. Each PR requires CI green, two-instance smoke test (C1/C2/C4), and manual feel recording in `specs/WEEKLY.md`.

Constraints: strict static typing, host-only gameplay logic with sync rules in doc comments, `StatBlock` modifiers (never base stat edits), shape caching (one per spec+charge bucket, never per-frame allocation), tests red-first, `Dev A` owns all five PRs per capability map.

Removed from request: "ask a human before editing .tscn" (noted in Constraints; work proceeds), progress reporting after each task (replaced by `.goals/LOG.md`), pauses for approval between PRs (replaced by CI gates).

